        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 6.2MW, onshore, foundation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 6.2MW, onshore, foundation
UUID=9e23b3a7-bb0d-3010-91f2-e71170fcc8a3
Wind turbine foundation, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Vestas V162-6.2MW onshore wind turbine (Mali &amp; Garrett, 2023).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9e23b3a7-bb0d-3010-91f2-e71170fcc8a3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
